## 3️⃣ **CSS lisäykset** - `theme.css`

```css
/* Collection Filters */
.collection-filters {
  background: #f8f9fa;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.filter-group {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.filter-group h4 {
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: #333;
}

.filter-group ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}

.filter-group li {
  margin: 5px 0;
}

.filter-link {
  color: #666;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  display: block;
  transition: background-color 0.2s;
}

.filter-link:hover {
  background: #e9ecef;
  color: #333;
}

/* FAQ Styles */
.faq-content {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}

.faq-items {
  margin-top: 30px;
}

.faq-item {
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding: 20px;
  background: white;
}

.faq-item h3 {
  color: #333;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  font-size: 1.2em;
}

.faq-item p {
  color: #666;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}
```

